      "id": "MIG-07-TELEMETRY-RESOLUTION",
      "title": "Compose telemetry execution-ID resolution into the F# work plan/context plan",
      "description": "Add a typed Ros.Domain.Work.TelemetryResolution module that composes a plan's abstract TelemetryIntent list with an observed candidate-execution read model, freezing the final item/event telemetryExecutionIds projection (or reporting that a new execution is required) before any state-changing effect handler renders the write set. Exposes a ros-fs work plan --resolve-telemetry shadow diagnostic and adds Node-vs-F# differential proof.",
