      "id": "ROS-AUTHORITY-SWITCH-DECISION",
      "title": "Open the ./ros authority-switch decision track (command-parity evidence + phased plan)",
      "description": "Per the user's request to redirect ./ros to the F# solution, and DF-ROS-2026-A027's requirement that such a redirect needs its own later accepted decision: collect EV-ROS-2026-A043 (full Node-vs-F# command-surface parity inventory; zero state-changing commands have F# parity today) and author DF-ROS-2026-A028 (the decision record opening a three-phase authority-switch track: full effect parity, distribution evidence, then the switch itself). No code changes; ./ros continues to invoke Node exclusively.",
      "tags": [],
