      "id": "MIG-07-GIT-PATH-COMPOSITION",
      "title": "Compose real Git observed/meaningful-path defaults into the F# work context-plan",
      "description": "Add Ros.Domain.Work.PathFilter (production-exact globMatch/meaningfulPaths port), Ros.Infrastructure.Work.FileWorkConfigRepository (reads ros.json workProtocol.meaningfulPaths/ignoredPaths field-by-field with production defaults), Ros.Domain.Git.GitBaseComparisonOutcome and ProcessGitRepository.createBaseComparison (optional ROS_BASE_REF committed-range diff, mirroring production's silent-skip-on-unresolvable/hard-fail-on-diff-error split). Wire ros-fs work context-plan to observe real Git status and configured meaningful/ignored patterns by default when --observed-git-path/--path are omitted, gated on the same action condition production gates gitPaths on. Adds Node differential proof and typed unit tests.",
